# Bee - Story

Did You ever wonder how it would be for You to have Your own bee hive?
This game allows You to have exactly that feeling and the story evolves around it.
You will gain knowledge about beekeeping and will need to answer questions to upgrade Your hive.

If You would like to know where You can download the game, click on #1.
If You would like to know the gameplay of the game, click on #2.